        "descriptions": [
          {
            "description": "We used single-cell RNA sequencing and T\u00a0cell receptor (TCR) sequencing on peripheral blood mononuclear cells from five patients with Duchenne muscular dystrophy before and after dosing with PF-06939926 fordadistrogene movaparvovec. Included in this repository are the following:\n\n\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0SS_MS_DMD_AAV_integrated.rds is a Seurat object containing single-cell gene expression for pre and post time points from all subjects. TCR information is included in the metadata slot.\n\nSupplemental Data File 1 PostvsPre_DEG_tables_ANNOTATED by_cell_type.xlsx contains the differentially expressed genes between the pre and post time points by immune cell population.\n\nMS_DMD_all_conga_final.h5ad is an AnnData object containing the final output of the CoNGA analysis. Results of the analysis are stored in adata.uns['conga_results']. See the github page for more information on the data structure: CoNGA github\n\n\u00a0",
            "descriptionType": "Abstract"
          }
        ],
